54-159. Paper DOI: 10.1111/j.1466-8238.2010.00584.x . Data DOI: https://doi.org/10.34892/1411-w728 Data URL: http://data.unep-wcmc.org/datasets/4&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2022-06-09T13:14:15.497+00:00&quot;,&quot;date_published&quot;:&quot;2011-01-01&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Download Dataset \n\nThis dataset shows the global distribution of mangrove forests, deri...&quot;,&quot;generic_image&quot;:false,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;c1ab54bba4184c49ac7831c915106aec&quot;,&quot;license&quot;:&quot;unep-wcmc-general&quot;,&quot;num_views&quot;:583,&quot;display_proteus_badge?&quot;:null,&quot;proteus?&quot;:true,&quot;proteus_exclusive?&quot;:false,&quot;resource_type&quot;:&quot;Geospatial Dataset&quot;,&quot;short_description&quot;:&quot;Global distribution of mangroves derived from earth observation satellite imagery. The aim was to use a globally consistent and repeatable methodology, to produce a high-resolution dataset.&quot;,&quot;tags&quot;:[&quot;unep-wcmc&quot;,&quot;coastal&quot;,&quot;blue carbon&quot;,&quot;remote sensing&quot;,&quot;satellite&quot;,&quot;USGS&quot;,&quot;mangrove&quot;,&quot;forest&quot;,&quot;habitat&quot;,&quot;ecosystem&quot;,&quot;unep-wcmc-general&quot;,&quot;ocean+&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Global Distribution of Mangroves USGS (2015)&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;GEOSPATIAL DATASET&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2024-05-28T10:57:06.019+00:00&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://data-gis.unep-wcmc.org/portal/sharing/rest/content/items/c1ab54bba4184c49ac7831c915106aec/info/thumbnail/thumbnail.JPEG&quot;},{&quot;avg_rating&quot;:0,&quot;citation&quot;:&quot;Tittensor DP, Mora C, Jetz W, Lotze HK, Ricard D, Vanden Berghe E, Worm B (2010). Global patterns and predictors of marine biodiversity across taxa. Nature 466: 1098-1101. URL: www.nature.com/nature/journal/v466/n7310/full/nature09329.html&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2022-06-17T14:07:14.454+00:00&quot;,&quot;date_published&quot;:&quot;2010-01-01&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Download Dataset \n\n\nThe dataset shows the global patterns of marine biodiversity (speci...&quot;,&quot;generic_image&quot;:false,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6e4991c32b574e6597e66a80af076955&quot;,&quot;license&quot;:&quot;unep-wcmc-general&quot;,&quot;num_views&quot;:1215,&quot;display_proteus_badge?&quot;:null,&quot;proteus?&quot;:true,&quot;proteus_exclusive?&quot;:false,&quot;resource_type&quot;:&quot;Geospatial Dataset&quot;,&quot;short_description&quot;:&quot;The dataset shows the global patterns of marine biodiversity (species richness) across 13 major species groups. The dataset was created alongside the publication by Tittensor et al. (2010a), to address the need for understanding on the distribution and drivers of marine biodiversity.&quot;,&quot;tags&quot;:[&quot;coastal&quot;,&quot;marine&quot;,&quot;high seas&quot;,&quot;model&quot;,&quot;COML&quot;,&quot;OBIS&quot;,&quot;species richness&quot;,&quot;biodiversity&quot;,&quot;unep-wcmc-general&quot;,&quot;ocean+&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Global Patterns of Marine Biodiversity (2010)&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;GEOSPATIAL DATASET&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2024-05-28T11:22:40.522+00:00&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://data-gis.unep-wcmc.org/portal/sharing/rest/content/items/6e4991c32b574e6597e66a80af076955/info/thumbnail/thumbnail1655475497766.png&quot;},{&quot;avg_rating&quot;:0,&quot;citation&quot;:&quot;Hutchison J, Manica A, Swetnam R, Balmford A, Spalding M (2014) Predicting global patterns in mangrove forest biomass. Conservation Letters 7(3): 233–240. doi: 10.1111/conl.12060;&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2024-10-11T09:03:39.956+00:00&quot;,&quot;date_published&quot;:&quot;2014-01-01&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Download Dataset \r\n\r\n\r\nThis dataset shows the modelled global patterns of above ground ...&quot;,&quot;generic_image&quot;:false,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;5cf653c59d664349ad1776313bf0e458&quot;,&quot;license&quot;:&quot;unep-wcmc-general&quot;,&quot;num_views&quot;:405,&quot;display_proteus_badge?&quot;:null,&quot;proteus?&quot;:true,&quot;proteus_exclusive?&quot;:false,&quot;resource_type&quot;:&quot;Geospatial Dataset&quot;,&quot;short_description&quot;:&quot;The is the first ever global map of predicted mangrove above-ground biomass, revealing the spatial variation in mangrove biomass, and giving more precise estimates of global and national-level biomass totals. Previous assessments had all extrapolated from mean biomass values, missing this spatial variation.&quot;,&quot;tags&quot;:[&quot;coastal&quot;,&quot;blue carbon&quot;,&quot;biomass&quot;,&quot;mangrove&quot;,&quot;habitat&quot;,&quot;marine&quot;,&quot;unep-wcmc-general&quot;,&quot;ocean+&quot;],&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Global Distribution of Modelled Mangrove Biomass&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;GEOSPATIAL DATASET&quot;,&quot;updated_at&quot;:&quot;2024-10-11T09:37:02.404+00:00&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://data-gis.unep-wcmc.org/portal/sharing/rest/content/items/5cf653c59d664349ad1776313bf0e458/info/thumbnail/thumbnail.JPEG&quot;},{&quot;avg_rating&quot;:0,&quot;citation&quot;:&quot;Green EP, Short FT (2003). World atlas of seagrasses. Prepared by UN Environment\nWorld Conservation Monitoring Centre. Berkeley (California, USA): University of\nCalifornia. 332 pp. URL: https://archive.org/details/worldatlasofseag03gree Data DOI: https://doi.org/10.34892/2dc6-1y45&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2022-06-16T08:50:12.861+00:00&quot;,&quot;date_published&quot;:&quot;-4712-01-01&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Download Dataset This dataset shows the global distribution of seagrass species richnes...&quot;,&quot;generic_image&quot;:false,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;917c4dc3350e4ef7bffd8ef583247e6d&quot;,&quot;license&quot;:&quot;unep-wcmc-general&quot;,&quot;num_views&quot;:553,&quot;display_proteus_badge?&quot;:null,&quot;proteus?&quot;:false,&quot;proteus_exclusive?&quot;:false,&quot;resource_type&quot;:&quot;Geospatial Dataset&quot;,&q